@StateMachineDemo.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5149

### Create a new order (Draft)
# @name createOrder
POST {{StateMachineDemo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Alice Johnson",
  "totalAmount": 1500.00
}

### Get order by ID
@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.id}}
GET {{StateMachineDemo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### Fire Submit trigger (Draft -> Submitted)
POST {{StateMachineDemo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/fire
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trigger": 0,
  "reason": "Submitted by customer"
}

### Fire StartReview trigger (Submitted -> UnderReview)
POST {{StateMachineDemo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/fire
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trigger": 1,
  "reason": "Assigned to manager"
}

### Fire Approve trigger (UnderReview -> Approved)
POST {{StateMachineDemo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/fire
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trigger": 2,
  "reason": "Credit check passed"
}

### Get state machine graph in Mermaid format
GET {{StateMachineDemo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/graph?format=mermaid
